OL,3,GNEWSATwo charged over fatal stabbing of
OL,4,A20-year-old man
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men have been charged with murder
OL,7,Fin connection with the death of a man
OL,8,Fin Newcastle-under-Lyme.
OL,10,FStaffordshire Police said Jamie Evans,
OL,11,F20, from Stone, died from a single stab
OL,12,Fwound on Friday evening.
OL,14,FCorey Hughes, 20, and Connor Edward
OL,15,FCartlidge, 22, have both been charged
OL,16,Fwith murder and possession of a knife
OL,17,Fin a public place, the force said.
OL,19,FA 19-year-old man, also from
OL,20,FNewcastle-under-Lyme, arrested on
OL,21,Fsuspicion of conspiracy to murder, has
OL,22,Fbeen released on conditional bail.
